+- trust
+- calm spacing
+- clear numbers
+- restrained accents
+- less fake chart spam
+- strong transaction clarity
+- subtle texture, not loud effects
+
+### Health / Fitness
+Prefer:
+- calm structure
+- strong metric hierarchy
