+## Tagging & Filtering
+
+### Using Tags
+
+```typescript
+test("user login @smoke @auth", async ({ page }) => {
+  // ...
+});
+
+test("checkout flow @e2e @critical", async ({ page }) => {
+  // ...
+});
+
+test.describe("API tests @api", () => {
+  test("create user", async ({ request }) => {
+    // ...
+  });
+});
