+
+## SEO audit checklist
+
+### Critical
+- [ ] HTTPS enabled
+- [ ] robots.txt allows crawling
+- [ ] No `noindex` on important pages
+- [ ] Title tags present and unique
+- [ ] Single `<h1>` per page
+
+### High priority
+- [ ] Meta descriptions present
+- [ ] Sitemap submitted
+- [ ] Canonical URLs set
+- [ ] Mobile-responsive
+- [ ] Core Web Vitals passing
+
+### Medium priority
+- [ ] Structured data implemented
+- [ ] Internal linking strategy
+- [ ] Image alt text
