+
+### Responsive Grid Gallery
+
+```html
+<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 p-4">
+  <div class="aspect-square bg-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
