+## 6. Maquinas de Estado (FSM)
+
+### 6.1 WorkRequest FSM
+
+```
+                    +-----------+
+                    |   draft   |
+                    +----+------+
+                         | submit()
+                         v
++--------+     +---------+-----------+     +-----------------+
+|cancelled|<----+      submitted      +---->+   visit_scheduled  |
++--------+     +----------+----------+     +--------+--------+
+   ^                      | qualify()                    |
+   |                      v                              | visit()
+   |            +---------+---------+                    v
+   |            |     qualified     +<----------+ visit_completed |
+   |            +---------+---------+           +--------+--------+
+   |                      | convert()                    |
+   |                      v                              | convert()
+   |            +---------+---------+                    |
+   +----------->| converted_to_proposal |<-----------------+
+                +-------------------+
