+## 2. Technology Stack
+
+### Backend
+| Technology | Version | Role |
+|-----------|---------|------|
+| Node.js | >=22.20.0 | Runtime |
+| Express | 5.2.1 | HTTP framework (async native) |
+| Mongoose | 9.3.x | MongoDB ODM |
